         <spinner name="bits" description="&lt;html&gt;The number of bits (i.e. digital input pins) that are read.&lt;br&gt;For example, set bits to '1' to read one pin (D0). Thew state of this pin can is bit '0' of the '165in' object.&lt;br&gt;One HC165 can read up to 8 bits (D0 to D7).&lt;br&gt;You can chain up to 4 HC165's to read up to 32 pins." MinValue="1" MaxValue="32" DefaultValue="0"/>
         <combo name="rate" description="&lt;html&gt;How much of the read loop is done at one time.&lt;br&gt;For example, '1/2' will read half of the pins during one k-rate cycle, the other half during the next k-rate cycle.">
